Job Summary
This position will assist the Finance Manager, Nigeria for developing and maintaining accounting principles, practices and procedures to ensure accurate and timely financial statements.
The position will be responsible of the General Ledger accounting within the perimeter of Nigeria office.
Main Responsibilities / Tasks
Ensure that all documents and information are recorded on-time and accurately in the accountancy system respecting local legal and corporate regulations;
Inventory: check inventory & stock take adjustments, standard cost variances
GL: Payroll entries, local and group adjustments, allocations, accruals
AR: Check sales integration, book non inventory invoices, challenge Import and Sales Support Specialist on AR bookings
FA: Book purchase, sale, scrap, depreciations
Treasury: supplier payments, bank reconciliation, liquidity report, book FX local adjustments
