About CompassNet
CompassNet helps companies in the tech industry to start and scale their sales and marketing teams globally. We provide outsourced sales and marketing solutions to companies in the payments, financial services, and digital commerce space. CompassNet is a third-party that recruits and hires sales and marketing candidates to our partner companies that are the best match for their skills, domain experience, and career goals.
Successful candidates will be working with our company partner, FasterPay.
About FasterPay:
FasterPay is a global e-wallet solution that helps businesses expand globally, and allows users to store and manage funds digitally. Founded in 2018, the UK-based company offers an end-to-end payment solution for local merchants who want to expand into global markets. Merchants integrated with FasterPay can access and monetize payments from over 170+ new markets, operate and withdraw funds in 20+ currencies into multiple bank accounts, all under one world-class secure platform.
The company operates in 13 global offices - London, Berlin, Lisbon, Kyiv, Sofia, Moscow, Bangalore, Beijing, Shenzhen, Manila, Hanoi, Seoul, and San Francisco.
