Job Description
Build‐up, maintain and process Master Project Schedule by using Project;
Tracking and monitoring of project activities including Engineering, Procurement, Construction, Commissioning and Installation;
Perform schedule analyses;
Provide the necessary plans/schedules to ensure the development of proper estimates and studies within a project stage and for sanction as necessary;
